ological, chemical or physical agents in food that can cause adverse health effects."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/food-safety-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Food safety hazard"},"altLabel":{"en":["Food hazard"]},"definition":{"en":"A biological, chemical or physical agent in food, or a condition of food, with the potential to cause an adverse health effect."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/emerging-food-safety-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Emerging food safety hazard"},"altLabel":{"en":["Emerging hazard"]},"definition":{"en":"A newly identified or changing hazard for which developing information may indicate a future food safety risk."}},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/known-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Known food safety hazard"},"altLabel":{"en":["Established hazard"]},"definition":{"en":"A hazard already recognized in existing food safety knowledge or risk analysis."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/recurring-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Recurring food safety hazard"},"altLabel":{"en":["Re-emerging hazard"]},"definition":{"en":"A known hazard that reappears over time, possibly through a new source, process or exposure route."}},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/forgotten-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Forgotten hazard"},"definition":{"en":"A previously documented hazard that is no longer actively recognized and may appear new when it re-emerges."}}]},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/unknown-hazard","prefLabel":{"en":"Previously unknown hazard"},"altLabel":{"en":["New hazard","Unexpected hazard"]},"definition":{"en":"A hazardous substance, organism or condition not previously recognized as a food safety hazard."}}]},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/food-safety-risk","prefLabel":{"en":"Food safety risk"},"definition":{"en":"A function of the probability and severity of an adverse health effect resulting from a hazard in food."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/emerging-food-safety-risk","prefLabel":{"en":"Emerging food safety risk"},"altLabel":{"en":["Emerging risk"]},"definition":{"en":"A risk resulting from a newly identified hazard involving potentially significant exposure, or from a known hazard involving an unexpected new or increased exposure."}}]},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/food-safety-incident","prefLabel":{"en":"Food safety incident"},"definition":{"en":"An occurrence in which a food product is associated with an actual or potential threat to health."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/food-contamination","prefLabel":{"en":"Food contamination"},"definition":{"en":"The presence or introduction of a potentially harmful biological, chemical or physical agent in food."}},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/one-off-incident","prefLabel":{"en":"Apparently unique food safety incident"},"altLabel":{"en":["One-off incident"]},"definition":{"en":"An incident initially considered unusual, unique or difficult to predict."}}]}]},{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/emerging-risk-identification","prefLabel":{"en":"Emerging risk identification"},"definition":{"en":"The systematic identification and evaluation of information that may indicate a new or changing food safety hazard or risk."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://fredbrug.github.io/skohub-pages/emerging-food-safety/early-signal","prefLabel":{"en":"Early signal"},"altLabel":{"en":["Early warning signal","Precursor signal"]},"definition":{"en":"Documented information that precedes public recognition of a food safety incident and may indicate the development of a food safety hazard or risk."},"narrower":[{"id":"https://